
Files: usr/lib/awgbar/awgcore
Comment: awgcore, the userspace tunnel, from https://github.com/artemimennoi/awgcore (private, not
 yet published), at the revision `awgcore --version` names. It links these Rust crates statically,
 vendored in its repository at the versions its Cargo.lock pins: aead, blake2, block-buffer,
 cfg-if, chacha20, chacha20poly1305, cipher, cmov, cpufeatures, crypto-common, ctutils, digest, hkdf,
 hmac, hybrid-array, inout, libc, poly1305, rand_core, typenum, universal-hash and zeroize (MIT OR
 Apache-2.0), fiat-crypto (MIT OR Apache-2.0 OR BSD-1-Clause), and curve25519-dalek, x25519-dalek
 and subtle (BSD-3-Clause). Their license texts are in /usr/share/doc/awgbar/licenses/awgcore.
